t; if Classical Echos hits YouTube `uploadLimitExceeded`/daily upload cap, fail over to Trapiistan/Sosai and then fareed320 for additional Viral Radar clips. Faceless/Daily Stoic videos use A F (`fareed320`) as their fixed primary channel. Viral Radar remains Classical Echos primary, then Trapiistan/Sosai, then A F as final failover. Keep hashtags out of YouTube titles; put them in description/tags. Never publish internal planning labels like “the part people will replay” or “clip 1”; every public title must be unique, true to the actual source video/clip, and specific enough that repeated generic titles like “The Uncomfortable Truth Hiding Here” are not reused across uploads. Public title/on-screen hook/subtitle must come from the video title + transcript/summary, be edgy/catchy/raunchy when the source supports it, but never explicit, misleading, or disconnected from what the clip actually says. Descriptions must be skimmable with blank lines: title, context/subtitle, Source, Original source URL on its own line as a hyperlink, edit/attribution note, then hashtags. Description hashtags must be relevant to the title + transcript/context (e.g. fitness, dating, business, numerology), not static filler; always keep #Shorts and #ViralRadar, but rotate topic tags based on what the clip actually says. Never include cron/cohort/internal run metadata in public descriptions.
